From 1abf9d7f62a982368dec2cb53f72779b11d06fd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Goswami <rgoswami@ieee.org>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:49:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] bench: add the lj38 fixed-cost default-on gate

Serial same-session gate for the lj38 fixed-cost change. It runs arms A,
B and a second build of A in palindromic blocks on lj38 (24 seeds) and
six default-preset cells (12 seeds), with a strict bit-identity check,
seed-paired outside-time and peak RssAnon bootstraps, and a path
counter patch for a separate non-timed build.
